OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder after
OL,4,Adeath of mum of two
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Fafter a mum of two was found dead at a
OL,8,Fproperty in Nottinghamshire.
OL,10,FAnna Zukowska, 52, was discovered at
OL,11,Fher home in James Close, Ollerton,
OL,12,Fshortly before 20:00 BST on Sunday,
OL,13,FNottinghamshire Police said.
OL,15,FOn Wednesday, the force said Jozef
OL,16,FZbigniew Oleszek, 60, also of James
OL,17,FClose, had been charged with her murder
OL,18,Fand was due to appear at Nottingham
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
